# "aah lead" (lead track): one held note while P1 morphs through every vowel and back (hum oo oh ah eh ee ue er),
# then a short phrase with the vowel moving under the notes. No clicks or zipper while P1 turns.
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 1.5
track lead
preset 0 128 5 90 220 50 0 0 128 0 128 195 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 12
sweep p1 255 0 12 20
note 0 A3 20 120
sweep p1 109 200 20 32
note 20 E4 4 110
note 24 D4 4 100
note 28 C4 4 115
bend 28 -100
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 52
expect peak_below -6
